%H A399601 Volodymyr M. Gavrylkiv, <a href="https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2606.28908">Note on the number of doppelsemigroups of small order</a>, arXiv:2606.28908 [math.GR] (2026).
%H A399601 Volodymyr M. Gavrylkiv, <a href="https://doi.org/10.15421/242602">Note on the number of doppelsemigroups of small order</a>, Res. Math. 34(1) (2026), 16-33.
%e A399601 For n = 3, there are exactly 4 pairwise nonisomorphic ideal extensions (D,-|,|-) of left zero doppelsemigroups by null quotients on the set D={0,1,2}. Rows and columns are ordered as 0,1,2. The Cayley tables of all four doppelsemigroups are listed below.
%e A399601 Doppelsemigroup #1:
%e A399601    -|:     |-:
%e A399601    0 0 0   0 0 0
%e A399601    0 0 0   0 0 0
%e A399601    0 0 0   0 0 0
%e A399601 Doppelsemigroup #2:
%e A399601    -|:     |-:
%e A399601    0 0 0   0 0 0
%e A399601    1 1 1   1 1 1
%e A399601    2 2 2   2 2 2
%e A399601 Doppelsemigroup #3:
%e A399601    -|:     |-:
%e A399601    0 0 0   0 0 0
%e A399601    1 1 1   1 1 1
%e A399601    0 0 0   0 0 0
%e A399601 Doppelsemigroup #4:
%e A399601    -|:     |-:
%e A399601    0 0 0   0 0 0
%e A399601    1 1 1   1 1 1
%e A399601    0 0 0   1 1 1
